    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113626" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρό-δοτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>given by hand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. δάνεισμα</span> money <i>lent without
				written acknowledgement,</i>
