				Poll.
				2.152
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. παράφερνα</span>”
				<i>movable goods,</i>
