			<i><span class="en">
				 ii 30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>furnished with hands,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				123.11
			</span></i>.</div>
